        "text": "rOpenSci's next Social Coworking and office hours is up in two weeks :tada:\n\nThese are casual online events for coworking and socializing generally centred on a theme related to R and tools for open\/reproducible science.\nYou can work quietly on your own, join in a discussion, or work while listening to the discussion, what ever suits you (and you don't have to follow the theme).\n\n:grey_exclamation: Theme: Getting to Know SORTEE\n:hourglass_flowing_sand: When: Tuesday September 1st 14:00 Europe Central (12:00 UTC)\n:cookie: Hosted by: Steffi LaZerte and co-host Ed Ivimey-Cook\n:mag: Details: <https:\/\/ropensci.org\/events\/coworking-2026-09|ropensci.org\/events\/coworking-2026-09>\n\nYou can use this time for...\n- General coworking\n- Visit <http:\/\/sortee.org|SORTEE>\n- Cowork independently on something related to R\n- Chat with Ed Ivimey-Cook and other attendees about our theme!",
